// B2 course (B1 → B2 roadmap), module 15 „Meedia, info ja kriitiline lugemine” (b1b2-071…075), stage B2.
// Lesson template v4 (docs/COURSE_DESIGN_COMMUNICATIVE.md §12). One storyline, the cast a year after the B1 course
// (docs/COURSE_CAST.md): on a Sunday evening a post in the Facebook group „Nõmme lapsevanemad” claims that the Kase kool
// kitchen will be closed and its cooks laid off — Jaan runs that kitchen. The post (by parent Maarika Saks, „from a sure
// source”) is shared 300 times; the news site Nõmme Teataja (reporter Henri Pärtel) runs the headline „Nõmme koolide
// köökide koondamine”, where „koondamine” means bringing kitchens together, not laying people off. In fact the Nõmme
// district government (official Ingrid) is only analysing school catering; its analysis even proposes that the Kase kool
// kitchen also cooks for a neighbouring kindergarten. Ülle's radio show „Päevateema” (Raadio Linnahääl) discusses media
// literacy with fact-check editor Kaia Mägi (the same Kaia as in the 075 check); Sofia checks a sales rep's claims for
// a client report at Tuul Logistika. One goal said on the first sheet: at the end the learner presents a fact-check at the
// Kase kool parents' evening (hoolekogu chair Marje Lepp) and writes a correction request to the news site (074 Kasuta).
// Grammar (B2 spiral, docs/METHODOLOGY_STANDARD.md §5): certainty and hedging (kindlasti, ilmselt, tõenäoliselt,
// väidetavalt, kuuldavasti) and the quotative -vat for recognition in 071; reported speech — allika sõnul / väitel, X
// leiab / rõhutab, et…, the quotative without a reporting verb (olevat, -vat, -tavat, ei olevat) in 072; nominalisation in
// headlines (köökide koondamine = köögid koondatakse) and the impersonal in news (otsustati, teatati, analüüsitakse)
// in 073; all of them in the summary and the correction in 074.
// Harno B2 formats: excerpts played once with multiple choice (071 Harjuta), a radio interview with true / false (072),
// the long problem article with multiple choice (073 Harjuta), a sentence bank and lecture notes (074 Harjuta), a debate
// with pro / contra cards and a decision (073 Kasuta), a summary with a comment (074), letters of 150–180 words.
// Module 14's words return: avalik teenus, kohalik omavalitsus, ametnik, taotlus, ettepanek, elanik, kogukond,
// vabatahtlik, eelarve, otsustama, osalema, õigus, vajadus, rahulolu, toetus, kättesaadavus, lahendus, kohustus.
//   071 the Facebook thread (cards), excerpts played once (radio news, voice messages, Kaia Mägi); Sofia questions the
//       sales manager of Robotlaod OÜ and writes Liis an evaluation.
//   072 Margus Lepik's opinion column „Koolisöök ei ole muuseum”; Ülle's „Päevateema” with Kaia Mägi (T/F); listeners'
//       calls — Helgi from Tartu, then the learner; a comment under the column.
//   073 the Nõmme Teataja news item and Jaan and Kadri on its headline; the long article „Ühisköök või oma köök?” (MC);
//       the district's public debate with argument cards and an opinion letter to the city council.
//   074 the district's analysis summary; Kaia Mägi's fact-check guide (sentence bank) and Maret's lecture on summaries;
//       the module project: the fact-check at the parents' evening and the correction request to Nõmme Teataja.
// Lesson 5 (075) is the module's check in Harno B2 form (unchanged). The v3 file is in archive/v3/b2/module15.js.
